ndi-config.v1.json: NDI receive transport for the videocomposer (ClickUp 869ekxuez,
plan rev 9). Disables RUDP, multicast, multi-TCP and unicast-UDP receiving, so NDI
falls back to its single base TCP connection. That stream can be carried by a plain
TCP relay on the controller (cuems-power-bridge /ndi/preview), which is how a node
shows a source it cannot reach directly. main() points NDI_CONFIG_DIR here unless
the variable is already set. JSON has no comments, hence this REUSE sidecar.
